ch_text","block_id":"0EQGM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DC5BF611-0574-4F20-9E32-3201F406A690","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"いまの人口比からして、いくらなんでも年功序列はもう無理でしょ","ts":"1620306719.186100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lio"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0abb3f18-983d-42f7-9d03-a48093d08667","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"あと社長の娘に婿入りしたやつが次期社長になったりしてた","ts":"1620306700.185400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZZYP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2427DF46-FCB4-43BB-B8BA-DAEDBDE8F62E","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"年功序列をまだやってる会社は普通に経営やばいと思うので、早めに株を手放した方が良い","ts":"1620306670.184900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Qtl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"893ef42f-4555-4288-a8b1-8369352a27fc","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"不思議","ts":"1620306631.183600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a5H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cbc145fa-7399-4924-bdb6-e40105ba3955","type":"message","user":"UGXMRNBUM","text":"前職では給料が勝手に上がるロジック、Nenko Joretsuが組まれてたので、社会って不思議って思いましたね","ts":"1620306610.183000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U7B4ZD49X","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Liy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"13AEEFB6-EE38-4570-8FD2-7B50734554CF","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"地元の工場系の同級生が毎晩飲み歩いては給料上がんないってぼやいてるのを見て、何でだろうと真面目に考えた結果、こいつら1ミリも勉強してないって気づいてしまったんですよ。","ts":"1620306576.182800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id